<navigator wx:if="{{outstandingCompensation}}" class="notice" url="/pages/orders/disputes?kind=compensation-receivables">有订单差额待补缴，查看明细 ›</navigator>
<view class="trade" wx:if="{{showCoupons}}">
  <view class="section hero"><view class="heading">选择优惠券</view><view>本次可节省 ¥{{draftSaving}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="feedback">{{message}}</view>
  <view class="section"><view class="heading">可用优惠券</view>
    <button wx:for="{{usableChoices}}" wx:key="id" class="coupon-option choice {{draftCouponId===item.id?'selected':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseCoupon" disabled="{{busy}}">
      <view>{{item.coupon.name}} · {{item.coupon.value}}</view><view>本单节省 ¥{{item.saving}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.coupon.validUntilText}} 到期 {{draftCouponId===item.id?'✓':''}}</view>
    </button>
    <button class="coupon-option choice {{!draftCouponId?'selected':''}}" bindtap="chooseCoupon" disabled="{{busy}}">不使用优惠 {{!draftCouponId?'✓':''}}</button>
  </view>
  <view class="section" wx:if="{{unavailableChoices.length}}"><view class="heading">本次不可用</view>
    <view class="choice disabled" wx:for="{{unavailableChoices}}" wx:key="id">{{item.coupon.name}}<view class="muted">{{item.reason}}</view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="footer"><button bindtap="cancelCoupons" disabled="{{busy}}">返回结算</button><button class="primary" bindtap="confirmCoupon" disabled="{{busy}}">确认选择</button></view>
</view>
<view wx:else class="trade">
<view wx:if="{{message}}" class="feedback">{{message}}<button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">重新读取</button><button wx:if="{{pending}}" bindtap="recover">查询原提交</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="notice">上次提交正在核实，请保留原内容并查询原提交，勿重复创建付款。</view>
<view wx:if="{{!detail && !message}}" class="blank"><mj-loading wx:if="{{busy && !returnRefresh}}" label="正在读取清单"/><text wx:else>暂无可结算清单</text></view>
<block wx:if="{{detail}}"><view class="section hero"><view class="heading">{{step===1?'确认配送':'确认结算'}}</view><view>{{detail.startDate}} 至 {{detail.endDate}} · {{detail.rentalDays}} 天</view><view class="muted">{{groups.length}} 个工厂，全额付款后分别生成订单</view></view>
<view class="section" bindtap="address"><view class="row"><text class="strong">收货地址</text><text class="link">选择 / 修改 ›</text></view><block wx:if="{{address}}"><view>{{address.receiverName}} · {{address.phone}}</view><view class="muted">{{address.regionText}} {{address.detailAddress}}</view></block><view wx:else class="muted">请选择收货地址</view></view>
<block wx:if="{{step===1}}"><view class="row"><text class="heading">配送方式</text><text class="link" bindtap="priceSheet">车型与运价 ›</text></view><view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="factoryId" class="section"><view class="heading">{{item.factoryName}}</view><list-filters quiet="{{returnRefresh}}" stacked filters="{{deliveryFilters}}" values="{{item}}" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" bindselectfilter="choice"/><textarea id="field-row-{{index}}-buyerRemark" adjust-position="{{false}}" value="{{item.buyerRemark}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="remark" maxlength="255" placeholder="给这家工厂的备注（选填）" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/></view></block>
<block wx:if="{{step===2 && quote}}"><view wx:for="{{quote.groups}}" wx:key="factoryId" class="section"><view class="row"><text class="heading">{{item.factoryName}}</text><text class="strong">¥{{item.amounts.total}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="prop" wx:key="snapshotItemId" class="item"><view class="picture"><public-prop-image image="{{prop.image}}" resource-type="checklist" resource-id="{{id}}" resource-version="{{detail.version}}"/></view><view class="item-body"><view class="item-title">{{prop.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{prop.quantity}} 件 · ¥{{prop.daily}} / 天</view><view wx:if="{{prop.transportRequirement}}" class="muted">运输要求：{{prop.transportRequirement}}</view></view></view><view class="row"><text>租金</text><text>¥{{item.amounts.rentOriginal}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>租金优惠</text><text>−¥{{item.amounts.couponDiscount}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>押金</text><text>¥{{item.amounts.deposit}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>{{item.outbound.serviceLabel}}</text><text>¥{{item.outbound.prepaid}}</text></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.outbound.vehicleTierNameText}}">{{item.outbound.vehicleTierNameText}} · {{item.outbound.distance}} km</view><view class="row"><text>{{item.return.serviceLabel}}</text><text>¥{{item.return.prepaid}}</text></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.return.vehicleTierNameText}}">{{item.return.vehicleTierNameText}} · {{item.return.distance}} km</view><view wx:if="{{item.buyerRemarkText}}" class="muted">{{item.buyerRemarkText}}</view></view><view class="section"><view class="row" bindtap="coupons"><text>优惠券</text><text class="link">已省 ¥{{quote.amounts.couponDiscount}} · 更换 ›</text></view><view class="row"><text>租金现金实付</text><text>¥{{quote.amounts.rentCash}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>押金合计</text><text>¥{{quote.amounts.deposit}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>运费预收</text><text>¥{{quote.amounts.freight}}</text></view></view><view class="notice">{{quote.transportNotice}} 优惠只抵租金；全部付款成功后按工厂生成订单。</view></block>
<view wx:if="{{priceSheet}}" class="sheet"><view class="heading">车型与运价</view><view wx:for="{{priceSheet.rules}}" wx:key="id" class="section"><view>{{item.vehicleName}} · {{item.cityCode}}</view><view>指导价 ¥{{item.min}}—¥{{item.max}}</view><view class="muted">起步含 {{item.includedDistanceMeter}} 米；超程每公里 ¥{{item.extra}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!priceSheet.rules.length}}">暂无已生效运价，配送报价暂不可用。</view><button bindtap="closeSheet">收起</button></view>
<view class="footer"><button wx:if="{{step===1}}" class="primary" bindtap="quote" disabled="{{busy||pending}}">下一步 · 获取报价</button><block wx:else><button class="secondary" bindtap="edit" disabled="{{busy||pending}}">修改配送</button><view wx:if="{{quote}}">合计<view></view>¥{{quote.amounts.total}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy||!quote}}">提交并支付</button></block></view></block></view>
